{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of <strong>cards</strong> and game board for hours of <strong>free fun</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear, uncluttered menus offer a wealth of possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a<strong> tutorial</strong> to learn the rules at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- play <strong>solo</strong> against 1 or up to 4 opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a fun <strong>Xp</strong> system to unlock your game, step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 <strong>expansions</strong> to renew the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a <strong>multiplayer</strong> mode to play as a family or take on opponents from all over the world.<br><br><strong><u>GamePlay :</u>Chakras</strong> are scattered around the game board.<strong><u></u></strong><br>To move, 3 types of cards are available:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Yin&quot; to move backwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Yang&quot; to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Karma&quot; to interact with your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chakra collected on the element circles (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water) makes you a Master of that element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first Master of 5 elements wins the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991680?t=1757566059","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991680/8e392031ffa0579531051a4eb28e1c30cda7a24f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757566059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991680/ae126d94778d9d93317e11aff740b3ee4fbea19e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757566059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991680/ae126d94778d9d93317e11aff740b3ee4fbea19e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757566059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"M